      "integration_review": "Inspected Core RC54 public fatigue API and Survival natural rest; published RC22 same signatures. Hydration v1 rev2 liquidWater and physiology, Thermal public status and Trauma API rev3. No foreign state mutation or second stamina pool. Missing source sip callback tracked in issue #257. Core RC56 natural recovery remains 4/s and no policy hook; #265 requests Core ownership, interim observed net-credit supplemental rest through public API only. Trauma disorder UI/reset #266, Hydration and Thermal reset #267. Core 1.5.1 API21 native rest handshake and heal coordinator inspected in #270; no extra exertion debit. Hydration 0.6.0 API5 actual batch callback #271 owns water item completion. Trauma API6 organ inputs now applied once to digestive throughput/immediate uptake and hepatic toxin clearance. No foreign state writes. Exact peer runtime pending. Aqua 0.4.6 actual public AquaApi.foodPortion in f9a745d1c236a952b63b8be554f61e488e221286, all 36 species; actual grams, no NBT, no duplicate ingestion. Joint exact peer runtime pending."
